    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Faculty at Aga Khan University's School of Nursing and Midwifery, SONAM, have launched a drive to enhance the skills of over 10,000 nurses, midwives and lady health visitors, LHVs, across Pakistan who are delivering care to COVID-19 patients in intensive care and high dependency units.",
